  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#333333\"><a name=\"top\"></a></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\" height=\"25\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n\n<font class=\"combo\" id=\"combos\" style=\"cursor:hand;\">Catalog*******</font>\n<div id=\"myDIV\">\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021022022731/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/basic.htm\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"각종팁\">Basic Tips</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/Diablo2/item_gems/\" title=\"젬\">GEM</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/Diablo2/item_jewels/\" title=\"주얼\">Jewels</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/Diablo2/item_charms/\" title=\"참\">Charms</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/Diablo2/item_runes/\" title=\"룬\">Runes</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/Diablo2/item_runewords/\" title=\"룬워드공식\">RuneWords</a><br>\n\t\t\t------------\n\t\t\t<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/Diablo2/item_setitems/\" title=\"세트아이템\">Set Item</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/Diablo2/item_unique/\" title=\"유니크아이템\">Unique Items</a><br><br>\n</div><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/images/left_menu/blizzard_logo.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"17\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:200/17\" width=\"200\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;<font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/images/left_menu/d.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/30\" width=\"30\">IABLO \n                            II - Runewords</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 소켓이 뚫려있는 아이템을 구하게 된다면 \n                    아래와같은 방식으로 룬을 조합하여</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;황금색 유니크 아템으로 \n                    이름이 변하면서 부가된 능력을 받을 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 3개의 룬워드를 필요로 한다면 3소켓의 아이템이 \n                    있어여 합니다 구멍이 남거나 모자른다면</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;아래의 룬워드조합에 \n                    적용을 못하게됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 각각의 룬워드 조합은 </span></font><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ral + Ort + Tal \n                    </span></b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">만약 이런 공식이라면 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;RAL룬을 \n                    끼고 Ort룬을 낀후 Tal룬을 끼어야 합니다.</span></font></p>\n</ul>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"450\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"262\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/images/item/rune/rune_main_1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"265\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:130/265\" width=\"130\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"271\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">I<img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/images/item/rune/rune_main.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"340\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:140/340\" width=\"140\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"539\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:5; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 위의 그림처럼 각각의 룬을 삽입하면 완성된 오른쪽 \n                            \n                            상태의 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;부가능력을 얻습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ </span></font><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ral + Ort + Tal \n                            의 조합은 3소켓의 방패만이 되고</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;부가능력은 \n                            50%방어상승과 콜드저항력 43%, 파이어,라이트닝,</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;포이즌저항력은 \n                            48% 마지막으로 10%데미지로 마나를 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;흡수합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 위의 방패는 9%방어상승이 있으므로 룬을 \n                            조합하여 +50%의</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;방어 상승이 있으므로 총 \n                            58%의 방어상승이 되므로</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:5; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;원래 방어가 86인 방패가 \n                            125로 변하는 것을 볼 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<center>\n<table border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"570\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th align=\"center\" colspan=\"4\" height=\"30\" width=\"544\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 아래의 룬워드 공식은 </span><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Diablo II: LOD v1.09 \n                                </span></b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;패치 버젼입니다.</span></font></p>\n</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"center\" width=\"74\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">룬워드</span></font></p></th>\n<th align=\"center\" width=\"134\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">허용아이템</span></font></p></th>\n<th align=\"center\" width=\"92\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">룬조합</span></font></p></th>\n<th align=\"center\" height=\"30\" width=\"232\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">완성된상태</span></font></p></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"74\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ancient's Pledge</span></b></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"134\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">3 </span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Socket Shields</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"92\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ral + Ort + Tal</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"232\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">+50% Enhanced Defense<br>\nCold Resist +43%<br>\nFire Resist +48%<br>\nLightning Resist +48%<br>\nPoison Resist +48%<br>\n10% Damage Goes To Mana<br>\n</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"74\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Black</span></b></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"134\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">3 Socket \nClubs/Hammers/Maces</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"92\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Thul + Io + Nef</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"232\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">+120% Enhanced Damage<br>\n40% Chance Of Crushing Blow<br>\n+200 To Attack Rating<br>\nAdds 3-14 Cold Damage - Cold Duration 3 Seconds<br>\n+10 To Vitality<br>\n+19 Poison Damage Over 2 Seconds<br>\n15% Increased Attack Speed<br>\nKnockback<br>\nMagic Damage Reduced By 2<br>\nLevel 4 Corpse Explosion (12 Charges)\n                                            </span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"74\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Fury</span></b></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"134\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">3 Socket Melee Weapons</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"92\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Jah + Gul + Eth</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"232\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">+209% Enhanced Damage<br>\n40% Increased Attack Speed<br>\nPrevent Monster Heal<br>\n66% Chance Of Open Wounds<br>\n33% Chance Of Deadly Strike<br>\nIgnore Target's Defense<br>\n-25% Target Defense<br>\n20% Bonus To Attack Rating<br>\n6% Life Stolen Per Hit<br>\n+5 To Frenzy (Barbarian Only)\n                                            </span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"74\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Holy Thunder</span></b></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"134\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">4 Socket Scepters</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"92\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Eth + Ral + Ort + Tal</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"232\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">+60% Enhanced Damage<br>\n-25% Target Defense<br>\nAdds 5-30 Fire Damage<br>\nAdds 21-110 Lightning Damage<br>\n+75 Poison Damage Over 5 Seconds<br>\n+10 To Maximum Damage<br>\nLightning Resistance +60%<br>